 cm."}],"correct_options":["D"],"answer":null,"explanation":"Measured length of rod = 3.50 cm\n<br><br>That means least count of the measuring instrument should be 0.01 cm = 0.1 mm\n<br><br>For vernier scale 1 main scale division = 1 mm\n<br><br>And 9 MSD = 10 VSD\n<br><br>Least count = 1 MSD - 1 VSD\n<br><br> = 1 - 0.9 = 0.1 mm"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>एक विद्यार्थी ने एक छड़ की लम्बाई मापकर <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.269ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3655 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> </text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"63\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-63\"></use><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\" transform=\"translate(444,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> लिखी। इसको मापने में उसने किस उपकरण का प्रयोग किया?</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"एक मीटर स्केल"},{"identifier":"B","content":"एक वर्नियर कैलिपर्स जहाँ वर्नियर स्केल के <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"ht